# Description: Detects the deletion of registry keys containing the MSTSC connection history
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((EventType:"DeleteValue" AND registry.path:*\\Microsoft\\Terminal Server Client\\Default\\MRU*) OR (EventType:"DeleteKey" AND registry.path:*\\Microsoft\\Terminal Server Client\\Servers\\*))
